  "arcade": {
    "letter": {
      "greeting": "Dear person reading this,",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Congratulations — you have surpassed my record. I hope you had fun with it. Enjoy your life the way you enjoyed the game; and if you didn't enjoy it, then I'm sorry you spent your time here.",
        "When I played this game I was in middle school. I played it after class, after lunch, in every minute that wasn't a lesson, with my classmates on our class's computer — and by the time I was about to graduate, I held a record that nobody could beat. As I grew up, I slowly forgot how much joy and peace I had there. I miss my friends and that time. If you have a moment, reach out to a friend you haven't spoken with in a long while. Trust me, it will be fun.",
        "By the way, I want to give you a sincere gift for beating my record. Send me an email with a screenshot of your time and your address.",
        "In case I never get to meet you: I wish you the best."
      ],
      "signoff": "Best,",
      "signature": "D"
    }
  }
